#: src/postulo_templates/plugin.py
msgid "More themes to set a CV in, beside Postulo's own: a CV laid out as the Europass CV is. Switched off, the themes are no longer offered, and a document set in one of them is drawn in the plain theme until it is switched on again."
msgstr "Tuilleadh téamaí chun CV a leagan amach iontu, taobh le téamaí Postulo féin: CV leagtha amach mar atá CV Europass. Múchta, ní thairgtear na téamaí a thuilleadh, agus tarraingítear doiciméad atá leagtha amach i gceann acu sa téama simplí go dtí go gcuirtear ar siúl arís é."

